---@class posthog.business_knowledge.SandboxRunStarted
---@field task_id string Sandbox task id. Poll this id until the run finishes.
---@field run_id string Run id for this question.

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.SandboxSearch
---@field tool posthog.business_knowledge.SandboxToolNameEnum Business knowledge tool the agent called. * `business-knowledge-documents-search` - Search * `business-knowledge-document-window-retrieve` - Window * `business-knowledge-repositories-search` - Repository search * `business-knowledge-repositories-file-retrieve` - Repository file
---@field input string Tool input the agent sent.

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.SandboxSource
---@field ref string Source reference the reply relies on.
---@field excerpt string Short excerpt that supports the reply.

---* `business-knowledge-documents-search` - Search
---* `business-knowledge-document-window-retrieve` - Window
---* `business-knowledge-repositories-search` - Repository search
---* `business-knowledge-repositories-file-retrieve` - Repository file
---@alias posthog.business_knowledge.SandboxToolNameEnum "business-knowledge-documents-search"|"business-knowledge-document-window-retrieve"|"business-knowledge-repositories-search"|"business-knowledge-repositories-file-retrieve"

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.SearchBusinessKnowledgeRepositoryRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field library_id? string Limit the search to repositories in this library. Pass the same id to document search and file read. Omit to search every selected repository.
---@field query string File names, path fragments, or identifiers to match. Not a full sentence.
---@field repo? string Limit the search to this owner/repo. It must already be selected. Omit to search every selected repository.

---* `pending` - Pending
---* `processing` - Processing
---* `ready` - Ready
---* `error` - Error
---@alias posthog.business_knowledge.SourceStatusEnum "pending"|"processing"|"ready"|"error"

---* `text` - Text
---* `url` - URL
---* `file` - File
---@alias posthog.business_knowledge.SourceTypeEnum "text"|"url"|"file"

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeLibrariesPartialRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field id string
---@field name? string New name. Omit to keep the current name.
---@field source_ids? posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeLibrariesPartialRequestSourceIdsList Replaces every source in this library. Omit to leave sources unchanged. An empty list removes them all.
---@field repos? posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeLibrariesPartialRequestReposList Replaces this environment's repositories in the library. Omit to leave them unchanged. Repositories only another environment allows stay.

---Replaces this environment's repositories in the library. Omit to leave them unchanged. Repositories only another environment allows stay.
---@alias posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeLibrariesPartialRequestReposList string[]

---Replaces every source in this library. Omit to leave sources unchanged. An empty list removes them all.
---@alias posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeLibrariesPartialRequestSourceIdsList string[]

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeSettingsPartialRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field learn_from_support_enabled? boolean When true, PostHog learns reusable knowledge from public human replies on resolved support tickets. Rejected when Support is off for this environment.

---@class posthog.business_knowledge.UpdateBusinessKnowledgeSourcesPartialRequest
